<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h1 id="content-cards">Content cards</h1>
<p>A corpus fixture exercising the reader-content blocks that render
structurally on native (A-04 / BR-APP-7): product-card, chart, row,
info-card, and diagram. Before A-04 these degraded to a markdown
string on native; this fixture pins the structural native projection.</p>

<div class="surfdoc-product-card"><div class="surfdoc-product-header"><div class="surfdoc-product-titles"><h3 class="surfdoc-product-title">Surf Pro</h3><p class="surfdoc-product-subtitle">For growing teams</p></div><span class="surfdoc-badge surfdoc-badge-green">Popular</span></div><div class="surfdoc-product-body"><p>Everything in Free, plus unlimited workspaces and priority Mako.</p>
</div><ul class="surfdoc-product-features"><li>Unlimited workspaces</li><li>Priority Mako routing</li><li>Shared conversation history</li></ul><a href="/pricing/pro" class="surfdoc-product-cta">Start free trial</a></div>
